      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَشْتٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> [<i>desert,</i> or <i>such as is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَحْرَآء</span>;
